                    {
                        "sense_id": "a9f075df-7a73-3932-8084-7cff1b7e21a2",
                        "entry_id": "5b02377b-43c1-351b-a1dc-dce69439b34f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Féminin singulier de prédateur."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "form-of"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f2ce2463-8903-4e56-9d3d-4a5e81923f03",
                                "sense_id": "a9f075df-7a73-3932-8084-7cff1b7e21a2",
                                "text": "Toutes ces transformations, dénommées bio-géo-physico-chimiques, se poursuivent actuellement, subissent l’influence néfaste de l’Espèce la plus polluante et la plus prédatrice qui ait jamais existé : l’Espèce Humaine."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "1d36a98f-840c-306f-adb1-824cf2aa458a",
                "word": "prédatrice",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "d013ab12-1fbc-4bd9-af48-797dee765294",
                        "entry_id": "1d36a98f-840c-306f-adb1-824cf2aa458a",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "prédatrices"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "51c17fb3-87ff-40cb-8abb-a69194ff2938",
                        "entry_id": "1d36a98f-840c-306f-adb1-824cf2aa458a",
                        "tags": [
                            "masculine"
                        ],
                        "form": "prédateur"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f82b1dc3-9e21-3cb1-a569-a13849570b7c",
                        "entry_id": "1d36a98f-840c-306f-adb1-824cf2aa458a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Animal qui chasse d’autres animaux pour s’en nourrir."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ca016bbd-261d-4515-96d5-0e6babc7fd9c",
                                "sense_id": "f82b1dc3-9e21-3cb1-a569-a13849570b7c",
                                "text": "La première [abeille], aux rayures caractéristiques noires et jaunes, est une prédatrice carnivore individualiste qui ne fabrique pas de miel et possède la faculté, grâce à son aiguillon lisse, de piquer plusieurs fois."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "809f6ae4-eb01-3cdc-8663-b3138cdcb088",
                        "entry_id": "1d36a98f-840c-306f-adb1-824cf2aa458a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Celle qui considère les autres comme des proies."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6c4daa9b-1bef-42ae-9eb0-589569fa05af",
                                "sense_id": "809f6ae4-eb01-3cdc-8663-b3138cdcb088",
                                "text": "Elle commençait de même à s’accoutumer à la souffrance — un concept absent de sa mémoire mentale et organique — qui la cernait à la façon d’une prédatrice omniprésente et tenace."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b4433d90-381b-4770-adc3-953874ccd752",
                                "sense_id": "809f6ae4-eb01-3cdc-8663-b3138cdcb088",
                                "text": "L’accusation a dépeint Mme Maxwell en «prédatrice sophistiquée» qui agissait à l'époque en toute connaissance de cause pour attirer et séduire des jeunes filles, parfois de 14 ans, et les livrer à Epstein dans ses résidences de la Floride, de Manhattan ou du Nouveau-Mexique."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c24e5ec6-384d-4ca7-b050-2ddc60568b8f",
                        "source_entry_id": "1d36a98f-840c-306f-adb1-824cf2aa458a",
                        "target_lang_word": "Prädatorin",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "291ef609-0038-4942-a095-3d404d6b131e",
                        "source_entry_id": "1d36a98f-840c-306f-adb1-824cf2aa458a",
                        "target_lang_word": "predator",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "predator",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ffc5a83d-49f2-325a-9502-53b3db8b8cfd",
                                        "entry_id": "09014bf5-9efa-383d-96c1-43956d3f2917",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any animal or other organism that hunts and kills other non-plant organisms (their prey), primarily for food."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "25718967-dec4-417b-9ad6-91fae49dd803",
                                                "sense_id": "ffc5a83d-49f2-325a-9502-53b3db8b8cfd",
                                                "text": "Hives should be positioned, oriented and protected to avoid predators and ensure survival in the meliponary. A study (pers. obs.) of predators shows that the main culprits in a Malaysian meliponary are frogs and lizards."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7febb5de-f022-4dab-b43b-ea0564e530e1",
                                                "sense_id": "ffc5a83d-49f2-325a-9502-53b3db8b8cfd",
                                                "text": "So if you're the only thing worth eating in the middle of the ocean, the predator that grabs you will probably have gotten there by a Levy walk."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f3169c32-3708-3e1a-91b6-955a24b42852",
                                        "entry_id": "09014bf5-9efa-383d-96c1-43956d3f2917",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone who attacks and plunders for gain."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "11e1e861-d543-3e80-b434-ef88eacefbdc",
                                        "entry_id": "09014bf5-9efa-383d-96c1-43956d3f2917",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sexual predator."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bfc4f128-c1cf-4dd5-bf63-8fa97819107f",
                        "source_entry_id": "1d36a98f-840c-306f-adb1-824cf2aa458a",
                        "target_lang_word": "beast of prey",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "beast of prey",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b355791f-3cb6-3a67-bb8b-789e9da0cdcf",
                                        "entry_id": "5291a8b1-e81d-35f4-8fc4-fe1cc65e06ef",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A carnivorous animal that hunts for its food, especially one that preys on vertebrates."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dc322692-ad1e-3e1e-b239-c21629e932a5",
                                        "entry_id": "5291a8b1-e81d-35f4-8fc4-fe1cc65e06ef",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A predatory person, savagely cruel and ruthless in their treatment of others."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0852c6f2-1b49-49be-aaf8-255f080e890f",
                                                "sense_id": "dc322692-ad1e-3e1e-b239-c21629e932a5",
                                                "text": "Much controversy has surrounded Nietzsche’s writings on the “higher” and “lower” types of man. Is he to be taken as glorifying the cruel tyrant, the “beast of prey”, or did he have some less repulsive ideal? The answer seems to be neither an unqualified yes nor an unqualified no."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
